%%{ init: { "sequence": { "mirrorActors": false, "actorMargin": 80 } } }%%
sequenceDiagram
    title M-Pesa STK Push Payment Flow

    participant Tenant as Tenant App
    participant API as API Server
    participant EdgeFn as Edge Function
    participant DB as Supabase DB
    participant Safaricom as Safaricom API

    Tenant->>API: Select invoice(s) to pay
    API->>DB: Fetch invoice details
    DB-->>API: Invoice data + amount
    API-->>Tenant: Show payment confirmation

    Tenant->>API: Confirm payment (amount, phone)
    API->>EdgeFn: POST /initiate-mpesa-stk-push
    EdgeFn->>DB: Query invoice ownership
    DB-->>EdgeFn: Verify tenant owns invoices

    alt Invalid invoice ownership
        EdgeFn-->>API: 403 Forbidden
        API-->>Tenant: Error: Invoice not yours
    end

    EdgeFn->>EdgeFn: Validate amount (±1 KES tolerance)
    EdgeFn->>EdgeFn: Generate idempotency key

    EdgeFn->>Safaricom: POST STK Push Request
    Safaricom-->>EdgeFn: CheckoutRequestID (pending)

    EdgeFn->>DB: Insert pending transaction
    DB-->>EdgeFn: Transaction created

    EdgeFn-->>API: 200 OK (CheckoutRequestID)
    API-->>Tenant: Payment request sent

    Note over Tenant,Safaricom: Customer receives M-Pesa prompt on phone

    Tenant->>Safaricom: Enter PIN, confirm
    Safaricom-->>EdgeFn: POST /mpesa-callback

    EdgeFn->>EdgeFn: Validate callback signature
    EdgeFn->>EdgeFn: Verify idempotency key

    EdgeFn->>DB: Check for duplicate receipt
    DB-->>EdgeFn: No duplicate found

    alt Payment successful (ResultCode: 0)
        EdgeFn->>EdgeFn: Parse callback metadata
        EdgeFn->>DB: Record payment transaction
        EdgeFn->>DB: Allocate to invoices
        EdgeFn->>DB: Update invoice statuses
        EdgeFn->>EdgeFn: Generate receipt
        
        EdgeFn->>Tenant: WebSocket: Payment complete
        EdgeFn-->>Safaricom: ACK
        
        Note over Tenant: Dashboard shows "Payment Successful"
    else Payment failed/cancelled
        EdgeFn->>DB: Record failed attempt
        EdgeFn-->>Safaricom: ACK
        EdgeFn-->>Tenant: WebSocket: Payment failed
    end

    EdgeFn-->>API: 200 OK
    API-->>Tenant: Show receipt / error

    Note over Tenant,DB: Reconciliation runs nightly to catch missed callbacks
